 \"professional\", \"worker\", \"person\", \"person or organization\", \"corporate body\", \"object\", \"entity\"]}\n\nWrong ranking:\n{\"types\": [\"producer\", \"creative producer\", \"co-producer\", \"line producer\", \"radio producer\", \"DJ producer\", \"professional\", \"worker\", \"person\", \"entity\"]}\n\nWhy the wrong ranking is wrong:\nThis ranking is wrong because it treats taxonomy neighbours as answer options, promotes classes that the entity description does not support, and omits the more specific description-supported target type.\n\nNow classify:\n\nEntity: SPIN model checker\nDescription: tool for verifying the correctness of software models\n\nTaxonomy context:\n- Direct parent classes: freely redistributable software, source-available software\n- Sibling classes: free software\n- Direct child classes: open-source video game, free and open-source software\n\nAnswer:",
